OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after masked burglar armed
OL,4,Awith knife steals cash and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fmasked man armed with a knife broke
OL,8,Finto a home in north Belfast.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at a property in
OL,11,Fthe Silverstream Drive area at
OL,12,Fapproximately 09:10 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe masked man demanded money from a
OL,15,Ffemale who was inside the house with
OL,16,Fanother man at the time. The suspect
OL,17,Fthen made off with a sum of cash and a
OL,18,Fvehicle that he stole from outside the
OL,19,Fproperty.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
