OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after masked burglar armed
OL,4,Awith knife steals cash and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe woman was unharmed in the incident,
OL,7,Fbut police have described it as a
OL,8,F"terrifying ordeal".
